%20bytes%3DreadProjectFileBytes%28new%20URL%28source.path%2Croot%29%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28current%2Cnew%20TextDecoder%28%27utf-8%27%2C%7Bfatal%3Atrue%7D%29.decode%28bytes%29%2C%27the%20exact%20correction%20accounts%20for%20every%20current%20source%20byte%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20forward.push%28%7Bid%3A%60mapping-capture-forward-%24%7Bindex%7D%60%2Clevel%3A%27emitter%27%2Cwhen%3A%5B%5B%27capture%27%2Csource.path%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20actions%3Asource.edits.map%28%28%5Bfrom%2Cto%5D%29%3D%3E%28%7Bop%3A%27replace%27%2Cfield%3A%27source%27%2Cfrom%2Cto%7D%29%29%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20reverse.push%28%7Bid%3A%60mapping-capture-reverse-%24%7Bindex%7D%60%2Clevel%3A%27emitter%27%2Cwhen%3A%5B%5B%27capture%27%2Csource.path%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20actions%3A%5B...source.edits%5D.reverse%28%29.map%28%28%5Bto%2Cfrom%5D%29%3D%3E%28%7Bop%3A%27replace%27%2Cfield%3A%27source%27%2Cfrom%2Cto%7D%29%29%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20return%20%7Bpath%3Asource.path%2Csource%3Asource.source%2Cedits%3Asource.edits%2Ccurrent%3A%7Bbytes%3Abytes.length%2Csha256%3Adigest%28bytes%29%7D%7D%3B%0A%20%20%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20profile%3D%7BschemaVersion%3A1%2ChistoricalRevision%3Aretained.historicalRevision%2C%0A%20%20%20%20historicalFixture%3A%7Bpath%3AGRAMMAR_SELECTION_HISTORICAL_FIXTURE%2Cbytes%3AfixtureBytes.length%2Csha256%3AGRAMMAR_SELECTION_HISTORICAL_SHA256%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20sources%2CforwardDecorators%3Anew%20DecoratorSet%28forward%29.toLino%28%29%2CreverseDecorators%3Anew%20DecoratorSet%28reverse%29.toLino%28%29%7D%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%20source%20of%20sources%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20original%3D%7Bcapture%3Asource.path%2Csource%3Asource.source%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20current%3DDecoratorSet.fromLino%28profile.forwardDecorators%29.decorate%28%27emitter%27%2Coriginal%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20assert.deepEqual%28DecoratorSet.fromLino%28profile.reverseDecorators%29.decorate%28%27emitter%27%2Ccurrent%29%2Coriginal%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20if%28check%29checkProjectData%28targe