ery%20complete%20paragraph%2Fbullet%20and%20its%20original%20heading%20context.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readContributorInstructionUnits%28source%29%20%7B%0A%20%20countContributorInstructionWords%28source%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20units%3D%5B%5D%2Cheadings%3D%5B%5D%2Ccontext%3D%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20let%20at%3D0%2Ccurrent%3B%0A%20%20const%20finish%3D%28%29%3D%3E%7Bif%28current%29%7Bunits.push%28current%29%3Bcurrent%3Dundefined%3B%7D%7D%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%20match%20of%20source.matchAll%28%2F%5B%5E%5Cn%5D%2A%5Cn%7C%5B%5E%5Cn%5D%2B%24%2Fgu%29%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20text%3Dmatch%5B0%5D%2Cstart%3Dat%3Bat%2B%3DBuffer.byteLength%28text%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20heading%3D%2F%5E%28%23%2B%29%20%28%5B%5E%5Cr%5Cn%5D%2B%29%5B%5Cr%5Cn%5D%2A%24%2Fu.exec%28text%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%28%2F%5E%5B%5Ct%5Cr%5Cn%20%5D%2A%24%2Fu.test%28text%29%29%7Bfinish%28%29%3Bcontinue%3B%7D%0A%20%20%20%20if%28heading%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20finish%28%29%3Bconst%20level%3Dheading%5B1%5D.length%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20context.length%3Dlevel-1%3Bcontext%5Blevel-1%5D%3Dheading%5B2%5D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20headings.push%28%7Blevel%2Ctext%3Aheading%5B2%5D%7D%29%3Bcontinue%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%20%20const%20bullet%3Dtext.startsWith%28%27-%20%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%28bullet%29finish%28%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%28%21current%29current%3D%7Bkind%3Abullet%3F%27bullet%27%3A%27paragraph%27%2Csection%3Acontext.join%28%27%20%2F%20%27%29%2Cstart%2Cend%3Aat%2Ctext%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20else%7Bcurrent.end%3Dat%3Bcurrent.text%2B%3Dtext%3B%7D%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20finish%28%29%3Bassert.equal%28at%2CBuffer.byteLength%28source%29%29%3B%0A%20%20return%7Bunits%2Cheadings%7D%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Verify%20actual%20files%20against%20complete%20reviewed%20sources%20without%20Git%2Fnetwork%20IO.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20verifyContributorInstructionCoverage%28%7Bagents%2Cclaude%2Crequest%2CversionRequest%7D%2Cpolicy%29%20%7B%0A%20%20for%28const%20value%20of%20%5Bagents%2Cclaude%2Crequest%2CversionRequest