hip%27%2C%27safe%20cleanup%27%5D%3B%0A%20%20const%20mapping%3D%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B0%5D%2C%5B1%5D%2C%5B2%2C3%5D%2C%5B3%2C4%5D%2C%5B6%5D%2C%5B6%5D%2C%5B4%2C7%5D%2C%5B7%5D%2C%5B8%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B1%2C9%2C15%2C17%5D%2C%5B9%2C12%5D%2C%5B9%5D%2C%5B10%5D%2C%5B11%5D%2C%5B15%5D%2C%5B15%5D%2C%5B16%5D%2C%5B12%5D%2C%5B13%5D%2C%5B14%5D%2C%5B14%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B16%2C17%5D%2C%5B16%5D%2C%5B16%2C17%5D%2C%5B18%5D%2C%5B16%2C17%5D%2C%5B15%2C16%2C18%2C19%5D%2C%5B18%2C19%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%3B%0A%20%20assert.equal%28mapping.length%2Coriginal.units.length%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20policy%3D%7BschemaVersion%3A1%2Cmodel%3A%27reviewed%20contributor%20instruction%20source%20coverage%201%27%2Csources%2C%0A%20%20%20%20request%3A%7Bpath%3ArequestPath%2Csource%3ArequestSource%2Csha256%3Adigest%28requestSource%29%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20versionRequest%3A%7Bpath%3AversionPath%2Csource%3AversionSource%2Csha256%3Adigest%28versionSource%29%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20currentUnits%3Acurrent.units.map%28%28source%2Cindex%29%3D%3E%28%7Bid%3Aids%5Bindex%5D%2Csource%7D%29%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20coverage%3Aoriginal.units.map%28%28source%2Cindex%29%3D%3E%28%7BoriginalIndex%3Aindex%2Csource%2CcoveredBy%3Amapping%5Bindex%5D.map%28index%3D%3Eids%5Bindex%5D%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20...%28index%3D%3D%3D3%3F%7BauthorizedCorrection%3Adigest%28requestSource%29%7D%3A%7B%7D%29%7D%29%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20additions%3A%5B%7Bunit%3Aids%5B5%5D%2Cauthority%3Adigest%28versionSource%29%7D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20boundary%3A%27This%20is%20a%20Root-reviewed%20exhaustive%20correspondence%20of%20all%2025%20original%20bullets%20and%20three%20surrounding%20instruction%20paragraphs%20to%20the%20shortened%20shared%20contract%2C%20with%20the%20explicitly%20authorized%20assertion%20correction%20and%20added%20version%20bounds.%20The%20original%20sources%20and%20every%20heading%2Fcontext%20are%20independently%20authenticated.%20Checks%20enforce%20retained%20wording%2C%20source%20coverage%20and%20measured%20concision%3B%20they%20do%20not%20prove%20ar