0original%20source%20buffers%2C%20retaining%20identities%2C%20cycles%2C%20roots%2C%20full%20CSTs%20and%20proofs.%27%2C%20%5B%27discoverySnapshotsReloadWithoutSource%27%2C%20%27linkCliTextAndVersionedBinaryAgree%27%2C%20%27snapshotIdentitiesRootsTreesAndProofsRetained%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-DYNAMIC-TRANSLATION%27%2C%20%27discovered%20languages%20execute%20and%20translate%20in%20the%20generic%20runtime%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27After%20installing%20a%20discovered%20language%20dynamically%2C%20ordinary%20parsing%20and%20Rust%2FJavaScript%20translation%20execute%20through%20the%20common%20algorithms.%20Changing%20a%20linked%20definition%20changes%20execution%20without%20changing%20the%20generic%20host%20runtime%3B%20stale%20certificates%20and%20incompatible%20definitions%20are%20rejected%20or%20revalidated%20explicitly.%27%2C%20%5B%27discoveredLanguageParsesAndTranslates%27%2C%20%27linkedMutationChangesGenericExecution%27%2C%20%27staleCertificatesRejectedOrRevalidated%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27dynamicKnowledgeRequest%27%2C%20dynamicSource%2C%20%27dynamic-knowledge-and-language-extension%27%2C%20%27dynamic-knowledge%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-KNOWLEDGE-RDF-SUPPORT%27%2C%20%27full%20Resource%20Description%20Framework%20representation%20and%20operations%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Both%20packages%20preserve%20the%20complete%20required%20RDF%20constructs%2C%20identities%2C%20relationships%2C%20literals%2C%20provenance%20and%20selected%20semantics%20as%20inspectable%20links.%20A%20finite%20triple%20example%20or%20opaque%20payload%20does%20not%20establish%20full%20RDF%20support.%27%2C%20%5B%27rdfConstructsPreserved%27%2C%20%27rdfSemanticsAndProvenanceExplicit%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-KNOWLEDGE-OWL-SUPPORT%27%2C%20%27full%20Web%20Ontology%20Language%20representation%20and%20operations%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Both%20packages%20represent%20the%20required%20OWL%20constructs%2C%20formal%20axiom