apshot%20becomes%20a%20complete%20dynamic%20representation%20on%20demand%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27A%20prepared%20static%20snapshot%20can%20be%20reconstructed%20on%20demand%20into%20the%20complete%20CST%20and%20concept%20space%2C%20retaining%20rules%2C%20formal%20definitions%2C%20identities%2C%20recursive%20links%2C%20source%20bytes%20and%20provenance%20instead%20of%20reconstructing%20a%20token%20list%20or%20descriptor.%27%2C%20%5B%27snapshotReconstructsFullCst%27%2C%20%27snapshotReconstructsFullConceptSpace%27%2C%20%27dynamicReconstructionRetainsProvenance%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-RECONSTRUCTION-RESOURCE-MEASUREMENT%27%2C%20%27measured%20latency%20and%20resources%20for%20complete%20dynamic%20reconstruction%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Both%20packages%20measure%20actual%20complete%20CST%20and%20concept-space%20reconstruction%20through%20the%20public%20link-cli%2C%20text%20Links%20Notation%20and%20binary%20Links%20Notation%20paths.%20Measurements%20record%20reconstruction%20latency%20and%20peak%20resources%20together%20with%20pinned%20input%20identity%2C%20representation%2C%20size%2C%20algorithm%20and%20execution%20environment%20provenance.%20The%20reconstructed%20graphs%20preserve%20the%20complete%20trees%2C%20rules%2C%20recursive%20formal%20definitions%2C%20identities%2C%20references%2C%20selected%20models%2C%20source%20bytes%20and%20provenance.%20Lazy%20loading%2C%20token-only%20reconstruction%20and%20descriptor%20creation%20cannot%20count%20as%20a%20measured%20full%20rebuild.%20These%20measurements%20retain%20the%20source%20qualitative%20speed%20requirement%20without%20inventing%20a%20numeric%20deadline.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27completeDynamicReconstructionMeasured%27%2C%20%27reconstructionLatencyAndResourcesRecorded%27%2C%20%27measurementInputAndEnvironmentProvenanceRetained%27%2C%20%27fullRepresentationPreservationRetained%27%2C%20%27lazyOrTokenOnlyReconstructionNotCounted%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-LINK-CLI-RECONSTRUCTION%27%2C%20%27dynamic%20reconstruction%20through%20link-cli%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27The%20dynamic%20representation%20can%20be%20recreated%20and%20processed%20through%20link-cli%20with%20a%20reproducible%20public%20path%2C%20preserving%20the%20complete%20trees%2C%20concept%20definitions%20and%20selected%20model.%27%2C%20%5B%27linkCliReconstructionExecuted%27%2C%20%27linkCliPreservesFullTreesAndConcepts%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-TEXT-LINKS-RECONSTRUCTION%27%2C%20%27dynamic%20reconstruction%20from%20text%20Links%20Notation%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Text%20Links%20Notation%20can%20serialize%2C%20reload%20and%20extend%20the%20complete%20dynamic%20CST%20and%20concept%20space%20without%20the%20original%20grammar%20or%20source%20buffers.%27%2C%20%5B%27textLinksDynamicRoundTripExecuted%27%2C%20%27textLinksPreservesCompleteRepresentation%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-BINARY-LINKS-RECONSTRUCTION%27%2C%20%27dynamic%20reconstruction%20from%20binary%20Links%20Notation%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Binary%20Links%20Notation%20can%20serialize%2C%20reload%20and%20extend%20the%20same%20complete%20dynamic%20representation%20with%20parity%20to%20its%20text%20form%20and%20without%20hidden%20authoritative%20side%20tables.%27%2C%20%5B%27binaryLinksDynamicRoundTripExecuted%27%2C%20%27textAndBinaryDynamicRepresentationsAgree%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-LANGUAGE-EXTENSION%27%2C%20%27algorithmic%20runtime%20extension%20with%20other%20languages%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Users%20can%20apply%20the%20shared%20algorithms%20to%20extend%20the%20dynamic%20meta-language%20with%20new%20languages%2C%20grammars%20and%20formal%20concepts.%20Extensions%20retain%20the%20global%20concept%20space%2C%20validation%2C%20source%20provenance%20and%20default%20behavior%20of%20existing%20catalog%20languages.%27%2C%20%5B%27dynamicLanguageExtensionExecuted%27%2C%20%27extensionUsesSharedAlgorithms%27%2C%20%27existingLanguageBehaviorPreserved%27%5D%5D%