7%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Deliver%20the%20complete%20authorized%20scope%20as%20quickly%20as%20available%20resources%20and%20correct%20verification%20permit%2C%20using%20useful%20parallel%20work%20and%20coherent%20batches.%20Continue%20independent%20drafting%20and%20implementation%20while%20CI%20runs%20instead%20of%20waiting%20idle%3B%20speed%20never%20substitutes%20for%20required%20behavior%20or%20evidence.%27%2C%20%5B%27independentWorkContinuesDuringCi%27%2C%20%27deliveryLatencyMinimizedWithoutScopeReduction%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-LATEST-REPOSITORY%27%2C%20%27latest%20repository%20version%20in%20the%20shared%20local%20checkout%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Before%20drafting%20the%20batch%2C%20the%20coordinator%20obtains%20the%20latest%20authorized%20repository%20and%20pull-request%20refs%2C%20reconciles%20required%20main%20changes%20and%20records%20the%20checkout%20revision%20used%20for%20implementation%20and%20CI%20feedback.%27%2C%20%5B%27latestAuthorizedRefsObtained%27%2C%20%27checkoutRevisionRecorded%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-BULK-EXACT-SCOPE%27%2C%20%27one%20bulk%20draft%20of%20exactly%20all%20issue%2C%20pull-request%20and%20conversation%20obligations%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Bulk%20work%20covers%20every%20registered%20issue%2C%20pull-request%20and%20conversation%20obligation%2C%20preserving%20all%20inherited%20scope.%20Drafting%2C%20implementation%20and%20reporting%20do%20not%20substitute%20narrower%20capabilities%20or%20omit%20unresolved%20requirements.%27%2C%20%5B%27entireRegisteredScopeIncluded%27%2C%20%27noScopeSubstitutionOrOmission%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-MINIMAL-LOCAL-RESOURCES%27%2C%20%27minimal%20local%20resources%20and%20targeted%20JavaScript%20validation%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Local%20work%20uses%20the%20minimum%20resources%20needed%20for%20targeted%20JavaScript%20validation%20and%20authoring.%20Full%20suites%2C%20whole-registry%20experiments%2C%20downstream%20workload%20clo