ate%2CBuffer.from%28row.sourceText%29%2C%7Brevision%3Ahistory.revision%2Cpath%3Arow.file%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20actual%3DreadFileSync%28new%20URL%28row.file%2Croot%29%2C%27utf8%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20current%3Drow.file.endsWith%28%27grammar_outcome_static_borrows.rs%27%29%3FrestoreNativeTestLintSource%28row.file%2Cactual%29%3Aactual%3Bassert.deepEqual%28pin%28current%29%2Crow.current%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20previous%3Dcurrent%3B%0A%20%20%20%20for%28const%20action%20of%20%5B...row.actions%5D.reverse%28%29%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28previous.split%28action.to%29.length%2C2%29%3Bprevious%3Dprevious.replace%28action.to%2Caction.from%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28previous%2Crow.sourceText%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20assert.throws%28%28%29%3D%3EverifyGitArtifactCertificate%28row.certificate%2CBuffer.from%28row.sourceText%2B%27%5Cn%27%29%2C%7Brevision%3Ahistory.revision%2Cpath%3Arow.file%7D%29%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20for%28const%20row%20of%20history.unchanged%29assert.deepEqual%28pin%28readFileSync%28new%20URL%28row.file%2Croot%29%29%29%2C%7Bbytes%3Arow.bytes%2Csha256%3Arow.sha256%7D%29%3B%0A%7D%29%3B%0A%0Atest%28%27every%20complete%20static-borrow%20test%20input%20and%20assertion%20remains%20exact%20modulo%20value%20preserving%20separators%27%2C%28%29%3D%3E%7B%0A%20%20const%20history%3DgenerateStaticBorrowModuleHistory%28%7Bcheck%3Atrue%7D%29%2Cprevious%3Dhistory.sources.find%28row%3D%3Erow.file.endsWith%28%27grammar_outcome_static_borrows.rs%27%29%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20current%3DrestoreNativeTestLintSource%28previous.file%2CreadFileSync%28new%20URL%28previous.file%2Croot%29%2C%27utf8%27%29%29%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%20name%20of%20%5B%27generated_static_reference_selection_preserves_all_independent_cases_and_resource_boundaries%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%27native_storage_returns_the_actual_existing_static_reference_without_allocating_a_new_lifetime%27%5D%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28normalizeNativeLiteralSeparators%28readSou