at%2Cat%2Bchunk.length%29.equals%28chunk%29%2C%27every%20original%20JSON%20row%20and%20whitespace%20byte%27%29%3Bat%2B%3Dchunk.length%3B%7D%0A%20%20assert.equal%28at%2Crange.end%29%3B%0A%20%20let%20converted%3DBuffer.concat%28%5Boriginal.blob.subarray%280%2Crange.start%29%2CBuffer.from%28specification.initializer%29%2Coriginal.blob.subarray%28range.end%29%5D%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20anchor%3DBuffer.from%28%22import%20%7B%20readStructuredDataLino%20%7D%20from%20%27..%2Fsrc%2Fstructured-data-links.js%27%3B%5Cn%22%29%2CanchorAt%3Dconverted.indexOf%28anchor%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.ok%28anchorAt%3E%3D0%26%26converted.indexOf%28anchor%2CanchorAt%2B1%29%3C0%29%3B%0A%20%20converted%3DBuffer.concat%28%5Bconverted.subarray%280%2CanchorAt%2Banchor.length%29%2CBuffer.from%28specification.importSource%29%2Cconverted.subarray%28anchorAt%2Banchor.length%29%5D%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20migration%3D%7BschemaVersion%3A1%2Crevision%3Aspecification.revision%2Cmodule%3Aspecification.module%2Ctable%3Aspecification.table%2C%0A%20%20%20%20baselineRows%3Aspecification.baselineRows%2Coriginal%3Apin%28original.blob%29%2Cliteral%3Apin%28original.blob.subarray%28range.start%2Crange.end%29%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20certificate%3Aoriginal.certificate%2Cconverted%3Apin%28converted%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20boundary%3A%27Lossless%20data%20relocation%20only.%20Every%20original%20naming-module%20byte%2C%20ordered%20row%2C%20field%2C%20source%20context%20and%20input%20remains%20reconstructible%20from%20converted%20code%20and%20the%20original%20data%20prefix.%20Identical%20scalar%20values%20share%20links%3B%20independent%20ordered%20containers%20remain%20distinct.%20Current%20appended%20bindings%20retain%20separate%20identities.%20No%20naming%20requirement%2C%20vocabulary%2C%20fixture%2C%20oracle%2C%20native%20behavior%20or%20gate%20is%20weakened.%27%7D%3B%0A%20%20verifyNamingSourceBindingData%28rows%2Cmigration%2Cconverted%29%3B%0A%20%20rows%3DshareNamingSourceScalarValues%28rows%29%3Bglobal.gc%3F.%28%29%3B%0A%20%20writePr