ource%20author%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20updated%3D%7B...structuredClone%28record%29%2Cedits%3Aresult.alreadyApplied%3FstructuredClone%28record.edits%29%3A%5B...structuredClone%28record.edits%29%2C...result.edits%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20publishedSha256%3Adigest%28result.source%29%2CpublishedBytes%3ABuffer.byteLength%28result.source%29%7D%3B%0A%20%20let%20inverse%3Dresult.source%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%20%7Bfrom%2Cto%2Ccount%7Dof%20%5B...updated.edits%5D.reverse%28%29%29%7Bassert.equal%28inverse.split%28to%29.length-1%2Ccount%29%3Binverse%3Dinverse.split%28to%29.join%28from%29%3B%7D%0A%20%20assert.equal%28inverse%2Crecord.original%2C%27all%20historical%20and%20new%20publication%20changes%20have%20one%20complete%20source%20inverse%27%29%3B%0A%20%20return%20%7Brecord%3Aupdated%2Csource%3Aresult.source%7D%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Reuse%20the%20complete%20original%20recipe%20while%20retaining%20independently%20published%0A%20%2A%20receipt%20fields%20added%20after%20it.%20The%20old%20author%20remains%20available%20unchanged.%0A%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20authorRunnerOverlayReceiptSourceViewEdits%28original%2ChistoricalRunner%29%20%7B%0A%20%20assert.equal%28digest%28historicalRunner%29%2C%27a584080a3b4f281c1b239ce81ffa8cd5ab135f9449700aa26d88c4e164b7415e%27%2C%27the%20complete%20original%20compiler-profile%20predecessor%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20previous%3DauthorRunnerOverlaySourceViewEdits%28historicalRunner%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.equal%28previous.edits.length%2C2%2C%27the%20complete%20historical%20producer%20correction%20recipe%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20tail%3D%27processes%3A%5B%5D%7D%3B%27%3B%0A%20%20const%20changes%3Dprevious.edits.map%28%28%7Bfrom%2Cto%2Ccount%7D%2Cindex%29%3D%3E%7B%0A%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28count%2C1%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%28index%3D%3D%3D0%29return%5Bfrom%2Cto%5D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20assert.ok%28from.endsWith%28tail%29%26%26to.endsWith%28tail%29%2C%27only%20the%20unchanged%20terminal%20receipt%20field%20is%20outside%20the%20member%20insertion%27%29%3B%0A%